		<description>Each Reichswehr Außenflotte is commanded by a Flottelegat, appointed personally by the Kaiserin. Sent beyond the Empire's borders, these expeditions are trials of leadership, where every decision is made without the shelter of the homeworld.\n\nAdvisors may counsel and officers may obey, but responsibility rests solely with the Flottelegat. Success brings honor and legitimacy; failure is remembered.\n\nThe Außenflotte is a succession trial fought under live fire. Surrounded by hostile powers, its commander must impose order, crush resistance, and fulfill the imperial mandate. Whether the Reich expands, endures, or bleeds rests upon their judgment alone.</description>
